weight 10 = how many simultaneous walls?  read off the deg4/deg6 columns:
that count is what a multiwall SOLVE must be asked for, per pair.
hub pairs are weight 10 automatically (body-diagonal curve, [P280]).
so T = 6*10 = 60 iff the three MUTUAL pairs also reach 10.

